[{"id":"CN-HTTP-011","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"计算机网络","tags":["HTTP","代理","502","504"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/computer-network/计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议.md","articleTitle":"计算机网络(五)HTTP 协议","articlePath":"posts/366484e7/"}],"articleIndex":11,"articleCount":16,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>遇到 502 或 504，如何区别网关和上游问题？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>先确认错误响应由哪个网关产生，再沿客户端到网关、网关到上游、上游内部的时间线检查 DNS、TCP、TLS、响应格式和超时。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>502 通常表示网关从上游得到无效响应，504 表示等待上游超时；状态码不能替代网关日志和上游证据，也不能直接指向某一段代码。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]},{"id":"playwright-route-actions","type":"choice","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["网络Mock","Route"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(九)API与网络.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(九)API与网络","articlePath":"posts/316789b8/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(九)API与网络.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(九)API与网络","articlePath":"posts/316789b8/"}],"articleIndex":2,"articleCount":2,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>需要模拟推荐接口断网时，应使用哪种路由动作？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>C\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>abort()\u003c/code> 注入网络失败；\u003ccode>fulfill()\u003c/code> 返回模拟响应；\u003ccode>continue_()\u003c/code> 修改后继续发送真实请求。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":["C"],"options":[{"key":"A","labelHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>continue_()\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"B","labelHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>fulfill()\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"},{"key":"C","labelHtml":"\u003cp>\u003ccode>abort()\u003c/code>\u003c/p>\n"}]}]